# LAMMPS input generated from LammpsInputFile with pymatgen v2026.3.9

# ============================================================
# Production MD workflow:
# 1. Minimization
# 2. NPT equilibration (with volume averaging over second half)
# 3. Rescale box to average volume -> NVT equilibration
# 4. Production NVT with per-type COM velocity tracking
# ============================================================

# Stage 2
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p

# Stage 3
read_data input.data
