# Stage 5
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

# ------------------------- Minimization -------------------------
dump d_min all atom 1 minimized.dump
min_style cg
minimize 1.0e-4 1.0e-6 10000 10000
